OL,3,ABritish man infected with Ebola in DR
OL,4,ACongo arrives in UK for treatment
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking earlier this week, a UK
OL,7,Fgovernment spokesperson said there were
OL,8,F"well-established procedures for
OL,9,Fdealing with cases like this" and that
OL,10,Fthe risk to the public remains low.
